{%- comment -%}
  Real-storefront availability probe.

  Shopify renders the password page with whichever theme is being previewed, so
  dropping this into an UNPUBLISHED theme's layout/password.liquid and fetching
  /?preview_theme_id=<that theme> returns genuine Shopify Liquid — real product
  objects, real market, real currency — on a password-protected store.

  Insert immediately after {{ content_for_layout }}. Remove when finished.
{%- endcomment -%}
